<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.ThirstHours>口渴耗尽时间</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.ThirstHours>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.ThirstHours.Desc>从口渴 80% 到空的小时数（25℃，不含高温加速与低口渴阶段减速）。默认 20 小时，可调 4–72；调小口渴更快，调大更慢。</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.ThirstHours.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.FoodWater>食物含水量</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.FoodWater>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.FoodWater.Desc>吃任何食物都按营养补水：口渴 + 营养 × 系数。默认 0.25（一份 1.0 营养的饭约等于 1.25 瓶水）；0 关闭。动物啃草、啃树同样生效。</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.FoodWater.Desc>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Section.BottledWater>瓶装水</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Section.BottledWater>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.BottledWater.Hint>调整矿泉水、纯净水、凉白开喝一瓶的效果。修改后下一次喝水生效。</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.BottledWater.Hint>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Mineral>矿泉水</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Mineral>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Purified>纯净水</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Purified>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Boiled>凉白开</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Boiled>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Thirst>解渴量</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Thirst>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Satiety>饱腹感</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Satiety>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Mood>心情</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.Mood>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.WorkTicks>凉白开工作时长</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.WorkTicks>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.MineralPoison>矿泉水可能中毒</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.MineralPoison>
	<ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.MineralPoison.Desc>关闭后矿泉水按干净水处理，不再做未处理水污染判定。纯净水和凉白开始终不会中毒。</ColonyKit.Settings.Hygiene.Water.MineralPoison.Desc>
</LanguageData>
